---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
const products=(await getCollection('products')).sort((a,b)=>a.data.order-b.data.order);
---
<Layout title="Product guide — compare designs and find specifications" description="Compare electric, adaptive, compact and sculpted personal wellness products. Find model-specific specifications and answers to common product questions.">
 <section class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">THE PRODUCT GUIDE</p><h1>Details that<br/>make a difference.</h1><p>A clear starting point for exploring the collection.</p></section>
 <article class="reading">
  <h2>Start with the design.</h2><p>Twist & Fun uses a cylindrical body with a viewing window. Starship has an open-form construction. Bobi III uses an adjustable strap. Mengqu takes a compact approach with a matching stand, while the sculpted series explores curved silhouettes and color variants. Compare the product photographs and specifications before choosing a model.</p>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table class="compare"><caption class="eyebrow" style="text-align:left">AT A GLANCE</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Product</th><th scope="col">Design focus</th><th scope="col">Explore</th></tr></thead><tbody>{products.map(p=><tr><th scope="row">{p.data.name}</th><td>{p.data.features[0]}</td><td><a href={`/products/${p.id}/`}>View details</a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
  <h2>A few useful answers.</h2>
  <details class="faq" open><summary>Where can I find dimensions and charging information?</summary><p>Each product page has a specifications section. Twist & Fun and Starship include dimensions, materials and charging information from their product sheets. Check your exact model and the manual supplied with it before selecting accessories.</p></details>
  <details class="faq"><summary>Do the devices use the same charger?</summary><p>No. The Twist & Fun product sheet lists USB-C charging, while Starship lists a DC socket. Use the charging accessories and power requirements specified for your model.</p></details>
  <details class="faq"><summary>How should I clean and store my device?</summary><p>Follow the cleaning instructions supplied with your exact model. Do not assume that different models have the same water resistance or cleaning requirements. Keep charging connections dry and allow the device to dry before storage.</p></details>
  <details class="faq"><summary>Are app features the same for every model?</summary><p>App availability, connection methods and supported features can differ between models and regions. Confirm compatibility using the documentation supplied with your device. Product appearance alone does not confirm an app feature.</p></details>
  <details class="faq"><summary>Who is this collection for?</summary><p>This collection is for adults aged 18 and over. These pages describe personal wellness products and do not claim to diagnose, treat or cure medical conditions.</p></details>
  <div class="guide-end"><a class="button primary" href="/products/">Explore the collection <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a></div>
 </article>
</Layout>
